  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "1. tooi 'far'\n\nYou can use the word tooi 'far', when you want to find out if the place to which you are going is far or near, as in the following example:\n\nTooi desu ka?    Is it far?\n\nTo understand the answer to this question, you will need to be able to pick up the following expression in addition to words like hai, ee, and iie.\n\nTooku arimasen.    (It's) not far."
    }
